{#-
  Shared frame for every English bounce auto-reply (PRD P1-2, WS-G).

  Structure, which every child template relies on:
    line 1            the subject, from block `subject`
    line 2            the literal separator `---`
    everything after  the plain-text body

  Blocks a child must define: `subject`, `defect`, `remedy`.
  Context comes from app.replies.bounce.ReplyContext and nothing else; a
  missing name raises (StrictUndefined) rather than rendering a gap.

  Deployment note: the signature block at the foot is literal text. Review it,
  and the Hindi one beside it, before this service sends mail to the public.
-#}
{% block subject %}{% endblock %}
---
Dear Sir or Madam,

Thank you for writing to us. We were not able to read the document sent with
your complaint, so the information in it has not been recorded yet.

What we found
{% block defect %}{% endblock %}

What you can do
{% block remedy %}{% endblock %}
{%- if attachment_name %}

Attachment received: {{ attachment_name }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if page_numbers %}
Pages affected: {{ page_numbers | join(", ") }}
{%- endif %}

Reference: {{ reference_id }}

Please reply to this message with the corrected document attached, and quote
the reference above. Your complaint is still with us: it has not been closed,
and no decision has been taken on it.

Complaint Processing Desk
This message was prepared automatically. If anything here is unclear, please
reply and a person will read it.
